msgid ""
"Agents, POS and cash managers: positive = owes the company, negative = the "
"company owes them (supply due). Drawers, wallets and banks: positive only."
msgstr ""
"Agents, POS et cash managers : positif = doit à l'entreprise, négatif = "
"l'entreprise leur doit (approvisionnement dû). Caisses, portefeuilles et "
"banques : positif uniquement."

